                            ["hint"] = "",
                            ["description"] = "\"The colors! So bright. Thank Peryite, it doesn't breathe vile fumes. Well, unless you've fed it fungus. Then it has the foulest breath ever. So. Don't feed it fungus.\"—Yamighu's New-New Journal",
