                            ["hint"] = "",
                            ["description"] = "Worshipers on pilgrimage in Mara's name may—rarely—wake to find one of her favored wolf steeds awaiting them. A not-so-gentle nudge from the Divine Mother.",
                            ["name"] = "玛拉之耀狼",
